cfm.digital_clock.info=Tells you the time of the overworld in 24HR format. Needs a battery to run: right click with one to install it (right click with another to swap), right click with an empty hand to take it out. Uses 1 FE every 2 minutes. SCP batteries, IC2 batteries and other batteries that provide Forge Energy work. The display can be coloured with your dye of choice.
cfm.tv_remote.info=Controls a TV wirelessly (point at a TV within 16 blocks). Left click: play/pause, hold: rewind. Right click: progress bar, hold: fast forward (10 s every half second). Sneak + left/right click: previous/next channel, hold: volume down/up. Sneak + pick block (middle click): danmaku on/off, hold: power on/off. Each press uses 2 FE from the battery. Not pointing at a TV: sneak + left click opens the local video settings, sneak + right click opens the battery compartment. Live rooms cannot be paused, rewound or fast-forwarded.

